      "comment" : "App Settings, Recordings: keeps the current keep period.\nEnviousMeet: closes the call-sound explanation without recording.\nEnviousMeet: keeps the meeting as it is.\nHistory meeting: stops writing the new summary.\nHistory selection: keeps the selected items.\nHistory transcript: stops Transcribe again with.\nLive Preview settings, Universal engine card: button. It stops the download.\nSettings > AI Polish, local model row: button that stops the download.\nSpeech engine settings, remove confirm box: keeps the speech model.\nYour Words, Learn from: the Forget learning memory confirmation: keeps the memory.\nYour Words, Learn from: the self-learning dictionary row: button that stops the download.",
