    "Each recording keeps its audio until you delete it. Delete the audio alone to keep the transcript." : {
      "comment" : "EnviousMeet page: how long recordings and their audio are kept.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Audiodaten jeder Aufnahme bleiben gespeichert, bis du sie löschst. Lösche nur die Audioaufnahme, um das Transkript zu behalten."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chaque enregistrement conserve son audio jusqu’à ce que vous le supprimiez. Supprimez uniquement l’audio pour conserver la transcription."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada grabación conserva su audio hasta que lo eliminas. Elimina solo el audio para conservar la transcripción."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each tab keeps its own search and filters. Pick a day in the date filter; a dot marks days with items." : {
      "comment" : "History help: search and filters are per tab; dots in the date picker.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
