    "Its notes, transcript, summary and recording are removed from this Mac. This can't be undone." : {
      "comment" : "History meeting card: confirmation message before deleting the whole meeting.\nHistory meeting page: confirmation message before deleting the whole meeting.",
      "localizations" : {
