    "Long meeting: this summary was written in parts. Some cloud models can fit longer meetings in one piece." : {
      "comment" : "History, a meeting summarized in parts by Apple Intelligence. Explains that some cloud AI models (OpenAI, Gemini, Claude) can summarize longer meetings in a single pass. Says some, not all, and does not promise unlimited meeting length.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
