    },
    "OK" : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish, notice button.\nButton that closes a message.\nDismisses an alert.\nEnviousMeet: closes the Save error.\nHistory: closes the Paste message.\nHistory: closes the message about a failed action.\nHistory: dismisses the Locate original result.",
