      "comment" : "EnviousMeet setup: stops the how-it-works cards from moving on by themselves.\nEnviousMeet: pauses the meeting recording.\nHistory transcript dock: pauses the original file.\nMicrophone settings, media during dictation: option that pauses what is playing.",
